482 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Graphic designer since 2009\054 specializing in digital media\056 Over the years\054 I have collaborated on the development of online advertising campaigns across regions like USA\054 EMEA and MENA\054 adapting high\055impact solutions to different markets\056\050\nIn addition to my expertise in design and creative production\054 I have experience coordinating teams and optimizing workflows\054 aiming to deliver high\055quality work efficiently\056\050\nI have worked for clients such as General Mills\054 NBA\054 Nestl\351\054 IOC\054 Richemont\054 Qatar Airways and Colgate\054 among others\056\050\nProficient in Adobe Creative Suite\054 Google Web Designer and Figma\056\n\n\nEXPERIENCE\n\n\nDigital Producer\054 WPP Media \023 Bogot\341\054 Colombia \023 March 2022 \050current job\051\n\nInteractive Designer\054 WPP Media \023 Bogot\341\054 Colombia \023 August 2021 \222 March 2022\n\nUI Designer\054 Asesoftware \023 Bogot\341\054 Colombia \023 May \222 August 2021\n\nJunior UX\057UI Designer\054 Packen \023 Bogot\341\054 Colombia \023 October 2020 \222 May 2021\n\nProduction Designer\054 VMLY\046R \023 Bogot\341\054 Colombia \023 August 2016 \222 October 2020\n\nFreelance Interactive Advertising Designer\054 Sancho BBDO \023 Bogot\341\054 Colombia \023 April \222 May 2016\n\nDigital Designer\054 J\056 Walter Thompson \023 Bogot\341\054 Colombia \023 February 2015 \222 February 2016\n\nFreelance Interactive Designer\054 OSG Digital \023 Bogot\341\054 Colombia \023 July \222 December 2014\n\nInteractive Designer\054 OSG Digital \023 Bogot\341\054 Colombia \023 September 2010 \222 December 2013\n\nDigital Designer\054 Leap Simple \023 Bogot\341\054 Colombia \023 January 2009 \222 September 2010\n\n\nEDUCATION\n\n\nAdvanced UX\057UI Design\054 Coderhouse \023 Online \023 2020\n\nFoundation HTML\054 CSS \053 JS\054 SuperHi \023 Online \023 2020\n\nUX\057UI Design\054 Ac\341mica \023 Online \023 2020\n\nCertified Illustration Course\054 Taller Arte Digital \023 Bogot\341\054 Colombia \023 2014\n\nGraphic Design\054 Universidad Jorge Tadeo Lozano \023 Bogot\341\054 Colombia \023 2005 \222 2009 )
